# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile instead of
# back/.dockerignore. The context is back/, but order-escrow only needs the
# generated Java code and its own directory: everything else (the legacy
# prototype in _legacy/, gen/go, gen/python, proto/, deploy/, .git, other
# services, local .env files, build outputs) stays out of the build context.
*
!gen/java/
!services/order-escrow/

**/.env
**/.env.*
services/order-escrow/build/
services/order-escrow/.gradle/
services/order-escrow/bin/
services/order-escrow/out/
